{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"1e11566dec97a7f3e903163fc17567578a45ec185b1e89be8aee26c9e0f33ba2"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1d43c2c58ed248631fc0ed4edd0ef66196117891d297b200912324f970dc446d","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"A tropical coastal destination in Southeast Asia","evidence":"[D27:1 | 2:18 pm on 12 September, 2023] Jolene: Hey Deb! So sorry for the late reply, been super busy. Last weekend my partner and I traveled to a meditation retreat for a few weeks in Phuket. Amazing experience! Nature, reflection and a break from engineering studies were awesome - it helped me find inner peace.\n[D29:4 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Jolene: We tried a scuba diving lesson last Friday and had an awesome time! We found a cool dive spot we can explore together. Trying new things opens up a world of adventure - maybe one day I'll be a certified diver. Anything fun going on with you?","itemId":"urn:uuid:322eefa3-de10-59e6-8eb8-a214dba27580","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f9c31ea1f13c6bced416301435954b000c06ad1987a5872877a34d3ab26f970e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Jolene and her partner find a cool diving spot?","referenceAnswer":"Phuket","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f9c31ea1f13c6bced416301435954b000c06ad1987a5872877a34d3ab26f970e"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}